      ],
      "text": "Growth hormone:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " start as early as age 2 if growth declines, short stature, or ↑likelihood of short stature; dose higher than for GH deficiency, typically 40–50 mcg/kg/day."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
